# Plebian-OS 0.2.0 Waydroid runtime closure (amd64).
#
# This file is data, not a shell fragment. plebian-os-waydroid-setup accepts
# only the keys below, validates every value, downloads each artifact over
# HTTPS, and verifies its SHA-256 before apt or zipfile sees it.
#
# Package records were taken from Waydroid's signed trixie repository metadata.
# Android archive hashes are the ids published by Waydroid's official OTA
# channels. The system image is VANILLA LineageOS 20; Google applications are
# intentionally not bundled.

# Weston comes from Plebian-OS's release-controlled Debian snapshot. Unlike
# the four Waydroid-repository packages below it needs no separate downloader,
# but first-use installation still requires this exact package version.
WAYDROID_WESTON_VERSION=14.0.2-1

